e routing money through a local operator, creating a cold-start problem\",\"leverage_point\":\"First 3-5 reference clients — once established, network effects compound because each successful transaction is a verifiable credential that attracts the next\",\"supporting_facts\":1,\"inferred_links\":4,\"confidence\":\"low\"},{\"chain\":\"Content/knowledge compounding → creates intangible assets that appreciate over time → because accumulated expertise in a specific domain becomes increasingly valuable as the domain grows → which means early knowledge investment in a rising field pays exponential returns in years 3-10\",\"bottleneck\":\"Domain selection — compounding only works if the domain itself is growing; knowledge in a shrinking domain depreciates\",\"leverage_point\":\"Building in public with systematic documentation — transforms private knowledge into a discoverable asset that attracts opportunities passively\",\"supporting_facts\":2,\"inferred_links\":3,\"confidence\":\"medium\"}]}"
