otential to sell the business or raise small capital for expansion.\"},{\"name\":\"downside\",\"probability\":0.30,\"timeline\":\"0-12 months of struggle, potential pivot or exit\",\"trigger\":\"Founder picks a commoditizing skill, competes on price against other Vietnamese/Filipino/Indian freelancers, AI tools eliminate the service category faster than expected, or founder burns $500 on tools/courses without generating revenue\",\"actions\":[\"SURVIVAL MODE: Cut all expenses, take any paying work to extend runway\",\"PIVOT: If original model fails by month 4, immediately switch to a model with faster cash generation (reselling, affiliate, local service)\",\"LEARN: Document what went wrong — the failure data is itself valuable for the next attempt\",\"DO NOT: Take debt, buy courses, or invest in tools before generating first dollar\"],\"outcome\":\"$500 lost, 6-12 months lost, but with hard-won knowledge about what actually works in the founder's specific context. This knowledge is the seed for attempt #2 which statistically has much higher success rate.\"}]}"
